Entries have additional symbol system which marks the ones that are being worked on and are, then, unfinished.

✥ - missing links

   referred usually to pages with several entries without links
   this is recommended state if you do not have full page ready to be filled in those linked pages

♜ - not finished entry

   entry which still needs to be updated/expanded

♢ - not linked entry

   there are some keywords in this entry that are not linked (usually by no page to be linked), so just inspect
   this entry to ensure it gets linked eventually when conditions for it are met